#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
msgid ""
"Stand in awe beneath the towering glass of Hudson Yards, glide past the neon "
"glow of Times Square, and admire the majestic architecture lining Fifth "
"Avenue and Central Park.\n"
"With engaging commentary from a born-and-bred New Yorker, you’ll hear the "
"captivating tales of immigrants and tycoons, jazz legends and Broadway "
"stars, street artists and architectural visionaries. From the historic "
"cobblestones of SoHo to the iconic views of the Brooklyn Bridge, you'll feel "
"the unique beat of every distinct neighborhood."
msgstr ""
"Fique admirado sob o vidro imponente de Hudson Yards, deslize pelo brilho "
"neon da Times Square e admire a arquitetura majestosa que contorna a Fifth "
"Avenue e o Central Park.\n"
"Com comentários envolventes de um nova-iorquino nato, você ouvirá histórias "
"cativantes de imigrantes e magnatas, lendas do jazz e estrelas da Broadway, "
"artistas de rua e visionários da arquitetura. Dos paralelepípedos históricos "
"do SoHo às vistas icônicas da Ponte do Brooklyn, você sentirá o ritmo único "
"de cada bairro distinto."

